  "director_notes": "Made to sit next to Pressure Jet without repeating it: Pressure Jet is a quick medium hose; this is a heavy cannon. Differences that matter: (1) a 620 ms brace with a swelling 34 px sphere, inward ripples and a hum, so the release has weight; (2) the column is three times as wide with strong churn (0.8), so surges visibly pound down it; (3) recoil on release (shake and a ripple kicked out from the caster's feet) and a towering crown at the target that sprays for the whole contact. Hero view is side, the view a side-scroller uses."
